    "14": "Up to 2 Celestian Insidiants can each have their condemnor bolt pistol replaced with 1 Munitorum hand flamer.",
    "15": "Up to 2 Celestian Insidiants can each have their condemnor bolt pistol and null mace replaced with 1 blessed sword.",
    "16": "One Celestian Insidiant’s condemnor bolt pistol and null mace can be replaced with 1 virge of admonition.",
    "17": "One Celestian Insidiant’s condemnor bolt pistol can be replaced with 1 Denuncia oratory.",
    "18": "One Celestian Insidiant equipped with 1 condemnor bolt pistol can be equipped with 1 Simulacrum Imperialis (that model’s condemnor bolt pistol cannot be replaced).",
    "19": "The Sacresant Superior’s hallowed mace can be replaced with 1 spear of the faithful.",
